Error [jet.InvalidRef]: `github@owner/repo` is not a valid package ref
 Why: A ref is `package@source`, optionally followed by `#version` or `#channel`, or a bare local path starting with `./`, `../`, or `/`.
 Fix: Write one of the legal forms: `ripgrep@jetpack`, `ripgrep@jetpack#14.1.0`, `owner/repo@github#v1.2`, or `./vendor/tool`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1358